  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Going to Kansas**: back after 61 archived shows (1166 days); rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **Cheshire County**: back after 88 archived shows (2148 days) [5]\n- **Insurance Fraud #2**: rare: 5 archived performances [5]\n- **Going Invisible 2**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2019-05-08** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 26 songs; 119 min; rated 5/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Recording is clear and crisp, with band and audience balanced well together [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: No Children, band returns woos and [1]\n- Reviewer attended, arrived hours early, and got to the front of the stage when doors opened [4]\n- Set mixed new and old songs, played to a perceptive, appreciative audience [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2019-05-08**: taped by LMGBTapes; transferred by LMGBTapes; source: SBD > dr680mkii + CA-14 Omnis (healy-ish, right stage lip) > CA Ugly 2 > pcm m10 [1]. Also: Recording was made by Kyle K., whom the reviewer says improves with every recording [4]",
